2. Fix the progress condition: `if((iters & ((uint64_t)1<<24)) == (uint64_t)1<<24)` no wait — the standard "every 2^24 iterations" is: `if((iters & ((1ull<<24)-1)) == 0 && iters>0)` or simply print when (iters >> 24) changes. Let me do this: `if((iters & ((1ull<<24)-1)) == 0 && (iters>0) && (iters < (1ull<<32)))` → prints 16 times. Also, reduce the number of prints: every 2^26 → 8 times.
